{# Mobile-only floating CTA. On mobile the logo fades out past 60px and the burger is
   the only persistent nav element, so there is nothing asking for the enquiry between
   the hero and the footer. Text rather than an icon — no glyph means "free quote", and
   "free" is the part worth saying. Hidden on desktop, which has a CTA in the site bar. #}
<div class="scta" id="scta">
  <a class="scta-dot scta-quote" href="/get-a-quote/" data-cta="quote" aria-label="Get a free quote">
    <span class="scta-t">Free quote</span>
  </a>
</div>
